    here is equivalent to two one-dimensional :func:`~torch.fft.fft` calls:

    >>> two_ffts = torch.fft.fft(torch.fft.fft(x, dim=0), dim=1)
    >>> torch.testing.assert_close(fft2, two_ffts, check_stride=False)

